%% Model data flow from source to model card.
flowchart LR
  SRC[Licensed source] --> GATE{License gate}
  GATE -->|SPDX allowlisted + human verified| CLEAN[Normalize + filter]
  GATE -->|otherwise| HOLD[Blocked]
  CLEAN --> DEDUP[Exact + MinHash near-dup clustering]
  DEDUP --> SPLIT[Cluster-level hash split]
  SPLIT --> TRAIN[train shards]
  SPLIT --> VAL[val shards]
  SPLIT --> TEST[test shards]
  TEST --> HOLDOUT[(Holdout store: evaluator only)]
  TRAIN --> TOKTRAIN[Tokenizer training: train split only]
  TOKTRAIN --> PACK[Tokenize + pack to .bin shards]
  VAL --> PACK
  PACK --> JOB[Authorized training job]
  JOB --> CKPT[(Checkpoints: safetensors + manifest)]
  CKPT -->|by hash, read-only| EVAL[grit-eval]
  HOLDOUT --> EVAL
  TRAIN -->|13-gram index| EVAL
  EVAL --> SIGNED[(Signed result)]
  SIGNED --> REVIEW[Human review]
  REVIEW --> CARD[Model card + report]
